### **1. Introduction & Project Goals**

The primary objective of this project is to develop an ultra-detailed predictive model for Teamfight Tactics (TFT). The user, acting as the lead developer, seeks to move beyond conventional statistical analysis of post-game match data. The goal is to create a model that incorporates nuanced, often overlooked, in-game mechanics such as unit positioning, itemization, and real-time combat interactions to achieve superior predictive accuracy.

